<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Проверка безопасности</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/admin_favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: linear-gradient(160deg, #0f0c29, #302b63, #24243e);
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      padding: 24px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      top: -50%;
      left: -50%;
      width: 200%;
      height: 200%;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 20%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15) 0%, transparent 50%),
                  radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 80%, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12) 0%, transparent 50%);
      animation: drift 20s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }
    @keyframes drift {
      0% { transform: translate(0, 0) rotate(0deg); }
      100% { transform: translate(-3%, 2%) rotate(2deg); }
    }
    .container {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      width: min(520px, 100%);
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75);
      backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(1.6);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(1.6);
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.15);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 48px 40px 40px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    }
    .shield {
      width: 72px;
      height: 72px;
      margin: 0 auto 24px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4);
      animation: pulse-glow 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes pulse-glow {
      0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4); }
      50% { box-shadow: 0 8px 48px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.6); }
    }
    .shield svg {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      fill: #fff;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #f1f5f9;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    }
    .desc {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .progress-wrap {
      width: 100%;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 100px;
      background: rgba(100, 116, 139, 0.25);
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .progress-bar {
      height: 100%;
      width: 0%;
      border-radius: 100px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6366f1, #a78bfa, #c084fc);
      background-size: 200% 100%;
      animation: bar-fill <%= redirectDelaySeconds %>s linear forwards, shimmer 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes bar-fill {
      0% { width: 0%; }
      100% { width: 100%; }
    }
    @keyframes shimmer {
      0% { background-position: 200% 0; }
      100% { background-position: -200% 0; }
    }
    .link {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #64748b;
    }
    .link a {
      color: #a78bfa;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.3);
      transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .link a:hover {
      color: #c4b5fd;
      border-color: rgba(196, 181, 253, 0.6);
    }
    .footer {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      margin-top: 32px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #475569;
    }
    .footer svg {
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
      fill: #6366f1;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="shield">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V5l-9-4zm0 10.99h7c-.53 4.12-3.28 7.79-7 8.94V12H5V6.3l7-3.11v8.8z"/></svg>
    </div>
    <h1>Проверка безопасности соединения</h1>
    <p class="desc">Подтверждаем, что ваше подключение безопасно.<br>Через мгновение вы будете перенаправлены.</p>
    <div class="progress-wrap">
      <div class="progress-bar"></div>
    </div>
    <p class="link">Если ничего не произошло — <a href="<%= redirectUrl %>">перейдите по ссылке</a></p>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18 8h-1V6c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5S7 3.24 7 6v2H6c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v10c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h12c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V10c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm-6 9c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2s.9-2 2-2 2 .9 2 2-.9 2-2 2zm3.1-9H8.9V6c0-1.71 1.39-3.1 3.1-3.1s3.1 1.39 3.1 3.1v2z"/></svg>
    защита данных — etoyatv
  </div>
  <script>
    (function() {
      var left = Number(<%= redirectDelaySeconds %>) || 5;
      var url = "<%= redirectUrl %>";
      var timer = setInterval(function() {
        left -= 1;
        if (left <= 0) {
          clearInterval(timer);
          window.location.href = url;
        }
      }, 1000);
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
